[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 841.75, "timestamp": "00:14:01", "text": "午飯後再回來什麼的。我猜我來這裡的時候會有一件事。這是Amul的玫瑰口味產品。喝。  好的。早餐吃了點魚"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 849.0, "timestamp": "00:14:09", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "just got out of the shower"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 851.069, "timestamp": "00:14:11", "text": "不錯。你好。歡迎來到直播間。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 858.687, "timestamp": "00:14:18", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "had some fish for breakfast "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 886.59, "timestamp": "00:14:46", "text": "早餐，想著要不要咬一口。看看這個。  我還沒在浴缸裡烤過麵包。  哦，我還沒打算洗澡呢。後退。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 892.902, "timestamp": "00:14:52", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "takin a bath, look at this JOQ AMBANI"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 898.11, "timestamp": "00:14:58", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "having toast in the bath"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 898.23, "timestamp": "00:14:58", "text": "後退。我很高興我的姐妹們在這裡。  打開這個很難。所以如果我吃了這個，我就2到3個小時內就什麼都吃不了"}]